"``OPENMV4P`` (\\ ``OMV4P_H7_32768_SDRAM``\\ ) e incluído o seu firmware com "
"o novo nome (\\ `c0dbdd9e5 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/c0dbdd9e5>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.4.0.rst:158
